\b 2. Purpose and Usage\b0\par
PauseCat is a lightweight Windows background application designed to reduce computer fatigue and improve user productivity by encouraging periodic breaks. You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use this software on your personal or professional devices.\par
\par
\b 3. Media and Content\b0\par
